    <string name="widget_refresh_title">Widget refresh</string>
    <string name="widget_refresh_body">Widgets update at midnight and whenever the date, time or time zone changes. The live ticker style also updates about every 15 minutes. Nothing runs in the background otherwise.</string>
    <string name="ok_got_it">Got it</string>
    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">Flipday keeps everything on your phone.\n\nWhat it stores: the events you create (titles, dates, reminder settings) and your app settings. They live in the app\u2019s private storage.\n\nWhat it does not do: it has no account, no ads, no analytics, no tracking and no network connection. Nothing is sent to the developer or to anyone else.\n\nNotifications: reminders are scheduled on your phone with Android\u2019s alarm service. You can turn them off in Android settings at any time.\n\nBackups: if Android device backup is on, Android may back up your events and settings to your own Google account. That is controlled by Android, not by Flipday. Export to file creates a file only where you choose to save it.\n\nDeleting: delete an event in the app, or uninstall the app to remove all data.\n\nQuestions: use Send feedback in About.</string>
